  title: Signal Tower Behind Fog
  key: 9
  topic: 3
  boardContentText: One signal tower could be hidden behind fog
  boardSprite: {fileID: 0}
  contentText: 'EMIL: So, look.

    [brief pause]

    EMIL: I turned up the intensity
    of the lighthouse. It drove the fog away. Suddenly I can see new things. There
    the whole time, behind that fog.

    [pause]

    EMIL: Interesting.

    [brief
    silence]

    EMIL: Now I don''t know if I''ve gone mad.

    [click]'
  paperSprite: {fileID: 0}
